## Key Function Signatures

- `new Hyperswarm(opts)`
- `new DHT(opts)`
- `swarm.join(topic, { server, client })`
- `core = new Hypercore(storage, [key])`
- `await core.append(blocks)` / `await core.get(index)`
- `drive = new Hyperdrive(corestore, [key])`
- `await drive.put(path, buffer)` / `await drive.get(path)`
- `modelId = await loadModel({ modelSrc, modelType })`
- `result = completion({ modelId, history, stream: true })`
- `await unloadModel({ modelId })`
- `wdk = new WDK(seedPhrase).registerWallet(chain, Manager, config)`

## Common Patterns

```js
// Hyperswarm + Hypercore replication
swarm.on("connection", (conn) => core.replicate(conn));
swarm.join(core.discoveryKey);
```

```js
// Corestore replication
swarm.on("connection", (conn) => store.replicate(conn));
```

```js
// Hyperdrive file CRUD
await drive.put("/note.txt", Buffer.from("hi"));
const buf = await drive.get("/note.txt");
```

```js
// QVAC streaming completion
const result = completion({ modelId, history, stream: true, kvCache: sessionId });
for await (const token of result.tokenStream) process.stdout.write(token);
```

```js
// bare-rpc over P2P (use wrapper — raw API is low-level)
import { createRPCServer, createRPCClient } from './lib/p2p-rpc.js'
swarm.on('connection', (socket, info) => {
  if (info.client) {
    const client = createRPCClient(socket)
    const res = await client.request('ping', {})
  } else {
    createRPCServer(socket, {
      handlers: { ping: async () => ({ ok: true }) },
    })
  }
})
// NOTE: raw bare-rpc has NO register(), NO request(string), NO destroy()
```

```js
// WDK account and balance
const account = await wdk.getAccount("ethereum", 0);
const balance = await account.getBalance();
```
